; ACTSink ACCUMULATION across matches.
; Upstream: ONE ACTSink is built per O-template BEFORE the query (space.rs:1576) and
; finalized ONCE after it (space.rs:1645), so all 6 (cux $a $b) paths land in ONE
; g8acc.act.  exec 1 reads that file back via the (I (ACT ...)) source.
; A port that builds a FRESH ACTSink per match and act_save()s per match would
; overwrite the file each time and read back only the LAST path.
(foo 1) (foo 2) (foo 3)
(bar x) (bar y)
(exec 0 (, (foo $a) (bar $b)) (O (ACT g8acc (cux $a $b))))
(exec 1 (I (ACT g8acc (cux $a $b))) (, (got $a $b)))
